{
  "about": [
    "isshoni:// deep-link cases (docs/m2/02-device-auth.md §12.1), shared by internal/client/deeplink's Go tests",
    "and web/src/lib/appLink.ts's tests.",
    "parse: Parse(link) must give the fields of an ok case, or an error of the kind named: invalid (refused: not",
    "a link, bad host or port, userinfo, over 2048 bytes, a space or a control character) or unsupported (a",
    "well-formed link with a path other than / and /r/<roomId>). padTo: append 'a' to the link until it has",
    "that many bytes (UTF-8) before parsing. built: Build(origin, roomId) of an ok case, which appLinkFor must",
    "match; Parse(built) gives the same fields.",
    "build: Build(origin, roomId) and appLinkFor(origin, roomId) must return link: https only (\"\" otherwise),",
    "and a room id that breaks the room-id rule gives the server's link without a room."
  ],
